       detector run. Nothing painted it, so accepting changed nothing you could see. -->
  <x:String x:Key="DetectedMarkerReviewConfirmed">confirmada</x:String>
  <!-- Why a file was matched to a title. The domain writes these as dotted codes and they travelled
       to the screen raw until 2026-08-21: the answer to "why do you think this is that film" was a
       namespace. A test scans src/ for the code literals, so a twelfth cannot be born without words.
       The key IS the code: a mapping would be a second place where the same name is written. -->
